<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1001A_S0009" variety="S0009">
<name>Lighting</name>
<ttl id="1001A_S0009_7421C_T001T" variety="T001T">
<name>Headlight Leveling Switch</name>
<para id="RM000001R7L001X" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="603JW-00" from="200612">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000001R7L001X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000001R7L001X_01_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___00008UT00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Headlight Leveling Switch</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Measure the voltage.</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between terminals 1 (B) and 4 (E) of the vehicle side wire harness connector. (Voltage A)</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E140356J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Connect the connector.</ptxt>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between connector terminals 2 (T) and 4 (E) from the back side of the connector when the headlight leveling switch is operated. (Voltage B)</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E188278J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</s3>
<s3>
<ptxt>Divide voltage B by voltage A to calculate the voltage ratio.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Switch Position</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Voltage Ratio (%)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>82.0±3</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>(0.5)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>76.1±3</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>70.2±3</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>(1.5)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>64.3±3</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>58.4±3</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>(2.5)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>52.5±3</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>46.6±3</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>(3.5)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>40.7±3</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>4</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>34.8±3</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>(4.5)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>28.9±3</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>5</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>23.0±3</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>When voltage A is 12V and voltage B is 10V, 10 ÷ 12 = 0.833 (83.3%).</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>LED Illumination Inspection</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E107909J02" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<s3>
<ptxt>Check the illumination condition of the LED when battery voltage is applied to the connector terminals.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.29in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.84in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Battery connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Specified Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Battery positive → 3 (ILL+)</ptxt>
<ptxt>Battery negative → 4 (E)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Comes on</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
